{"id":"9276eacf7530187d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-tc0.md","title":"TC⁰","display":"df-tc0 — TC⁰","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-tc0","aliases":["28-df-tc0","TC0"],"display":"df-tc0 — TC⁰","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §23.5 and chapter notes mention TC⁰; local threshold-circuit definition","source_printed_pages":"505–506","source_pdf_pages":"531–532","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-tc0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-tc0</span><span>TC0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tc0 — TC⁰"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §23.5 and chapter notes mention TC⁰; local threshold-circuit definition"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"505–506"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"531–532"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；以 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a> 的编号无环图为底层，额外允许标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{thr}(\\theta)\">\\(\\mathsf{thr}(\\theta)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>阈值电路的常量、输入、NOT、AND、OR 条件及求值与布尔电路相同；深度按最长路径、大小按非输入节点数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1}\">\\(\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tval}\">\\(\\operatorname{tval}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tout}\">\\(\\operatorname{tout}\\)</span> 为以下形式构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>每个候选记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\">\\(C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in V\">\\(v\\in V\\)</span>。下标与门标签均沿用布尔电路定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1}\\coloneqq\\{C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau):\\;&amp;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;[\\exists\\lambda:V\\to\\mathbb N\\ \\forall(u,v)\\in E\\ \\lambda(u)&lt;\\lambda(v),\\ V=[N],\\ N\\ge\\max\\{n,1\\},\\ E\\subseteq V^2,\\\\\n&amp;\\vec\\imath\\in V^n,\\ \\vec o\\in V^1,\\ \\forall j,k\\in[n]\\;(j\\ne k\\Rightarrow i_j\\ne i_k),\\\\\n&amp;\\tau:V\\to\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{thr}(\\theta):\\theta\\in\\mathbb Z\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in V\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\ (\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j\\leftrightarrow v=i_j),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)\\in\\{0,1,\\mathsf{in}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{in}_n\\}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\varnothing],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not}\\Rightarrow|\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)|=1]]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1}\\coloneqq\\{C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau):\\;&amp;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;[\\exists\\lambda:V\\to\\mathbb N\\ \\forall(u,v)\\in E\\ \\lambda(u)&lt;\\lambda(v),\\ V=[N],\\ N\\ge\\max\\{n,1\\},\\ E\\subseteq V^2,\\\\\n&amp;\\vec\\imath\\in V^n,\\ \\vec o\\in V^1,\\ \\forall j,k\\in[n]\\;(j\\ne k\\Rightarrow i_j\\ne i_k),\\\\\n&amp;\\tau:V\\to\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{thr}(\\theta):\\theta\\in\\mathbb Z\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in V\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\ (\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j\\leftrightarrow v=i_j),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)\\in\\{0,1,\\mathsf{in}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{in}_n\\}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\varnothing],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not}\\Rightarrow|\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)|=1]]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nx_j&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j,\\\\b&amp;\\tau(v)=b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\\\1-\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not},\\ \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\{u\\},\\\\\n\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{and},\\\\\n1-\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}(1-\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u))&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{or},\\\\\n\\mathbf1[\\sum_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u)\\ge\\theta]&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{thr}(\\theta).\n\\end{cases}\\qquad(C\\in\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1},\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,\\ v\\in V)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nx_j&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j,\\\\b&amp;\\tau(v)=b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\\\1-\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not},\\ \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\{u\\},\\\\\n\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{and},\\\\\n1-\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}(1-\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u))&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{or},\\\\\n\\mathbf1[\\sum_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u)\\ge\\theta]&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{thr}(\\theta).\n\\end{cases}\\qquad(C\\in\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1},\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,\\ v\\in V)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tout}_C(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(o_1),\\qquad \\operatorname{tsize}(C)\\coloneqq|V\\setminus\\{i_1,\\ldots,i_n\\}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{tdepth}(C)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_\\ell)\\in V^{\\ell+1},\\ v_\\ell=o_1,\\ \\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}\\;(v_j,v_{j+1})\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tout}_C(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(o_1),\\qquad \\operatorname{tsize}(C)\\coloneqq|V\\setminus\\{i_1,\\ldots,i_n\\}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{tdepth}(C)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_\\ell)\\in V^{\\ell+1},\\ v_\\ell=o_1,\\ \\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}\\;(v_j,v_{j+1})\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{TC}^0\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists(C_n)_n\\ \\exists a,c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [C_n\\in\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\operatorname{tsize}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{tdepth}(C_n)\\le d\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{tout}_{C_n}(x)=1)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{TC}^0\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists(C_n)_n\\ \\exists a,c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [C_n\\in\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\operatorname{tsize}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{tdepth}(C_n)\\le d\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{tout}_{C_n}(x)=1)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>R5 修订：在电路构造中显式加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq V^2\">\\(E\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>、门条件的顶点量词域和求值参数域，避免依赖“底层图”文字省略而对未定义的顶点调用拓扑编号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>整数阈值只需截断到 0 至扇入加一，故其编码长度有多项式界。本模型等价于常深度、多项式规模、无界扇入多数门电路；这里选择非一致版本。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§23.5 and chapter notes mention TC⁰; local threshold-circuit definition，印刷页 505–506；PDF 页 531–532。本条为明确标识的本地扩展，原书没有本条全部形式陈述。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；以 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]] 的编号无环图为底层，额外允许标签 $\\mathsf{thr}(\\theta)$，$\\theta\\in\\mathbb Z$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{thr}(\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tval}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tout}","display":false},{"tex":"C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1}\\coloneqq\\{C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau):\\;&\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;[\\exists\\lambda:V\\to\\mathbb N\\ \\forall(u,v)\\in E\\ \\lambda(u)<\\lambda(v),\\ V=[N],\\ N\\ge\\max\\{n,1\\},\\ E\\subseteq V^2,\\\\\n&\\vec\\imath\\in V^n,\\ \\vec o\\in V^1,\\ \\forall j,k\\in[n]\\;(j\\ne k\\Rightarrow i_j\\ne i_k),\\\\\n&\\tau:V\\to\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{thr}(\\theta):\\theta\\in\\mathbb Z\\},\\\\\n&\\forall v\\in V\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\ (\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j\\leftrightarrow v=i_j),\\\\\n&\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)\\in\\{0,1,\\mathsf{in}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{in}_n\\}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\varnothing],\\\\\n&\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not}\\Rightarrow|\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)|=1]]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nx_j&\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j,\\\\b&\\tau(v)=b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\\\1-\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u)&\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not},\\ \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\{u\\},\\\\\n\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u)&\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{and},\\\\\n1-\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}(1-\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u))&\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{or},\\\\\n\\mathbf1[\\sum_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(u)\\ge\\theta]&\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{thr}(\\theta).\n\\end{cases}\\qquad(C\\in\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1},\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,\\ v\\in V)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tout}_C(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tval}_{C,x}(o_1),\\qquad \\operatorname{tsize}(C)\\coloneqq|V\\setminus\\{i_1,\\ldots,i_n\\}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{tdepth}(C)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\ell\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_\\ell)\\in V^{\\ell+1},\\ v_\\ell=o_1,\\ \\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}\\;(v_j,v_{j+1})\\in E\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{TC}^0\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists(C_n)_n\\ \\exists a,c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [C_n\\in\\operatorname{ThCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\operatorname{tsize}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{tdepth}(C_n)\\le d\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{tout}_{C_n}(x)=1)]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"E\\subseteq V^2","display":false}],"bytes":3641,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"一致性与电路类：[[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]、[[28-df-nc]]、[[28-df-nc1]]、[[28-df-ac0]]、[[28-df-tc0]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d"]}